WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.160
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.240 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:13.120 --> 02:16.320
She failed the tribulation.

02:22.200 --> 02:23.320
Big Blockhead!

02:25.400 --> 02:26.760
Big Blockhead, are you all right?

03:47.560 --> 03:49.200
The Goddess of Xishan.

04:11.920 --> 04:14.720
I thought I was just an ordinary plant.

04:15.200 --> 04:16.120
But now…

04:18.519 --> 04:19.720
Moon Supreme Lord,

04:20.240 --> 04:21.440
tell me.

04:21.519 --> 04:23.080
I don't belong to the Fairy Tribe

04:23.160 --> 04:24.720
or the Moon Tribe.

04:24.800 --> 04:26.440
So what am I?

04:27.040 --> 04:28.880
The Xilan Holy Seal.

04:28.960 --> 04:30.320
So she is…

04:43.320 --> 04:44.160
Orchid.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.280
Orchid!

04:46.920 --> 04:48.800
Xie Wanqing is really dead.

04:49.640 --> 04:50.720
Xiao Run is also dead.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.240
They failed in their tribulations.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.240
I'm going to kill you!

05:06.520 --> 05:08.160
My lord, take Fairy Orchid away first.

05:30.160 --> 05:31.360
Do you want to leave?

05:33.240 --> 05:34.520
You are no match for him.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.520
Don't go after him.

06:12.800 --> 06:13.640
Fairy Danyin.

06:15.000 --> 06:17.000
Please take care of my master's corpse

06:17.880 --> 06:19.240
and bury her properly.

06:19.880 --> 06:21.360
Lord Changheng

06:25.760 --> 06:27.320
has also failed his tribulation.

06:28.880 --> 06:30.160
His spirit has dissipated.

06:37.080 --> 06:38.240
Not necessarily.

06:39.040 --> 06:41.200
Before I came here,
I saw Changheng's destiny in this life.

06:41.760 --> 06:42.920
Changheng's tribulation

06:43.600 --> 06:44.840
is not to kill Xie Wanqing.

06:45.640 --> 06:46.840
In this life,

06:47.520 --> 06:49.600
he dies to save the one he cares about.

06:53.320 --> 06:54.440
The one he cares about?

06:57.880 --> 06:59.560
It should have been Orchid.

07:02.480 --> 07:03.840
It shouldn't have been me.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.080
What happened to me?

08:07.640 --> 08:08.880
What is this place?

08:10.920 --> 08:11.800
You're fine.

08:12.400 --> 08:14.040
We're about to reach the Oblivion River.

08:15.000 --> 08:16.040
After we cross the river,

08:16.880 --> 08:18.280
we'll be able to go home.

08:24.800 --> 08:27.160
SHENSHUI HALL, SHUIYUNTIAN

08:33.480 --> 08:34.880
I didn't expect that

08:34.960 --> 08:36.159
I could find a confidant today.

08:36.240 --> 08:39.280
Have we met before?

08:39.840 --> 08:41.600
The fairy in the painting?

08:43.240 --> 08:44.240
From now on,

08:44.320 --> 08:45.960
I, Xiao Run, and Mr. Dongfang

08:46.040 --> 08:47.560
are sworn brothers.

08:47.640 --> 08:49.000
It's so ugly.

08:49.080 --> 08:51.640
It didn't even show a bit of my beauty.

08:55.200 --> 08:56.520
You are right.

08:56.600 --> 08:58.160
It should belong

08:58.720 --> 09:00.360
to the one I really love.

09:00.920 --> 09:02.200
It wasn't until I met you

09:03.000 --> 09:03.960
that I realized

09:05.120 --> 09:06.440
you must be its owner.

09:08.520 --> 09:09.440
Orchid.

09:33.320 --> 09:34.520
Orchid,

09:34.600 --> 09:35.480
sit down.

09:47.280 --> 09:48.400
Big Blockhead.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.600
Are you all right?

10:14.880 --> 10:16.840
What a bunch of losers.

10:37.160 --> 10:38.840
Why can't I command Hellfire?

10:45.200 --> 10:46.240
Big Blockhead.

10:53.640 --> 10:56.000
Dongfang Qingcang
is at the end of his rope.

10:56.960 --> 10:57.880
Kill him.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.160
No!

10:59.240 --> 11:00.080
Orchid.

11:01.800 --> 11:03.040
Stop!

11:08.320 --> 11:09.480
Lord Changheng.

11:09.560 --> 11:11.000
Did you pass your tribulation?

11:20.200 --> 11:21.960
Since Changheng, the God of War,

11:22.040 --> 11:23.440
has returned from his tribulation,

11:23.520 --> 11:26.880
it's imperative
to destroy Dongfang Qingcang.

11:26.960 --> 11:28.440
Who dares to harm her?

11:28.520 --> 11:30.000
Fairy Orchid is a fellow immortal,

11:30.080 --> 11:31.360
not a traitor to Shuiyuntian.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.480
Anyone who harms her

11:33.560 --> 11:35.360
will make an enemy of me!

11:42.880 --> 11:44.480
Since the God of War vouches for her,

11:44.560 --> 11:47.800
I guess there must be a misunderstanding.

11:49.560 --> 11:50.480
Fine.

11:53.200 --> 11:55.160
After killing Dongfang Qingcang,

11:55.640 --> 11:58.760
Orchid can return to Shuiyuntian,

11:58.840 --> 12:00.600
safe and sound.

12:03.480 --> 12:05.200
Orchid, come home with me.

12:05.760 --> 12:06.680
Come home?

12:08.800 --> 12:11.120
Although I haven't left
Shuiyuntian for long,

12:13.160 --> 12:14.920
my life in Arbiter Hall

12:15.600 --> 12:17.760
seems like thousands of years

12:17.840 --> 12:19.480
or tens of thousands of years ago.

12:19.960 --> 12:23.120
Even in my dreams, I want to go home.

12:23.200 --> 12:25.520
I miss the flowers and plants
at Arbiter Hall,

12:26.000 --> 12:28.280
Aunt Sansheng's nagging,

12:28.840 --> 12:30.600
and Fairy Danyin's loud voice.

12:30.680 --> 12:31.840
I had always thought

12:31.920 --> 12:34.120
I could live peacefully in Yujing,

12:34.640 --> 12:36.200
gradually growing

12:36.760 --> 12:38.400
into an old fairy.

12:38.920 --> 12:39.800
Come back with me.

12:40.320 --> 12:41.520
Nothing will change.

12:41.600 --> 12:43.000
If you return to Shuiyuntian,

12:43.480 --> 12:44.840
whether you go back to Arbiter Hall

12:44.920 --> 12:45.960
or come to Fountain Palace,

12:46.040 --> 12:46.880
it will be your choice.

12:46.960 --> 12:47.920
I promise

12:48.640 --> 12:49.640
that no one in Shuiyuntian

12:50.200 --> 12:51.560
will treat you badly.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.240
I'm sorry,

12:54.840 --> 12:56.120
Lord Changheng.

13:00.480 --> 13:01.480
Orchid!

13:11.480 --> 13:13.240
Obstinate.

13:14.240 --> 13:15.200
Kill them!

13:31.160 --> 13:32.840
Changheng.

13:34.160 --> 13:36.960
I've been patient with you

13:37.040 --> 13:38.680
since you're my brother.

13:38.760 --> 13:40.280
Yet you're in league

13:40.360 --> 13:41.920
with Dongfang Qingcang

13:42.000 --> 13:43.240
and a traitor of Shuiyuntian

13:43.320 --> 13:45.320
and openly rebelling.

13:45.400 --> 13:46.840
This is an unforgivable sin!

14:03.320 --> 14:04.640
Changheng.

14:06.200 --> 14:07.720
Do you want to rebel?

14:08.480 --> 14:10.240
I used to respect you as my brother.

14:11.040 --> 14:12.760
For millennia, I obeyed the laws of heaven

14:12.840 --> 14:14.120
and followed your lead.

14:15.120 --> 14:17.000
But after this tribulation
in the Mortal World,

14:17.080 --> 14:18.440
I've come to understand a lot.

14:19.000 --> 14:21.000
Not until today did I realize

14:21.080 --> 14:22.160
that in your eyes,

14:22.640 --> 14:24.960
Mother's fervent love
for her sons is cowardice

14:25.840 --> 14:28.160
and my longing
for the person I love is a mistake.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.760
You view all sincere feelings

14:29.840 --> 14:32.160
as merely foolish and unbearable.

14:32.240 --> 14:34.080
If this absurdity is the law of heaven,

14:34.760 --> 14:36.040
so what if I rebel against it?

14:43.720 --> 14:45.760
The immortal criminal Changheng

14:46.520 --> 14:48.200
openly rebelled,

14:49.120 --> 14:51.320
committing the same crime
as the Moon Tribe.

14:52.600 --> 14:54.000
If anyone sees him,

14:56.480 --> 14:58.320
kill him without mercy.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.280
Congratulations, my lord.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.640
It has been 30,000 years.

15:13.320 --> 15:14.880
This moment has finally come.

15:15.520 --> 15:17.240
It's funny that they had the fate poem,

15:17.880 --> 15:19.920
but they never grasped
the true meaning of the poem.

15:20.880 --> 15:23.000
I've followed my master
through thousands of lifetimes.

15:24.160 --> 15:25.200
I've already figured out

15:25.840 --> 15:29.320
that she has to die
in every life because of her beloved one.

15:29.400 --> 15:30.640
So the beloved that was mentioned

15:32.320 --> 15:34.480
is not just the most obvious choice.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.480
The one who needed to make the kill

15:36.560 --> 15:38.280
to help my master pass the tribulation

15:39.000 --> 15:40.520
was actually Dongfang Qingcang,

15:40.600 --> 15:42.400
whom she truly loved in this life.

16:00.960 --> 16:01.800
Master.

16:03.240 --> 16:05.760
Finally, you don't have
to suffer through any more tribulations.

16:06.320 --> 16:07.320
Don't worry, Master.

16:07.400 --> 16:08.960
I've placed your primordial spirit

16:10.000 --> 16:12.000
in a safe place

16:12.520 --> 16:14.880
to help you complete
the last step before the resurrection.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.240
It is a place

16:19.360 --> 16:21.400
that no one can guess.

17:29.080 --> 17:32.040
Didn't you always say
that you are the supreme lord

17:33.600 --> 17:35.080
and the strongest of the three realms?

17:38.560 --> 17:41.240
So you'll be fine, right?

17:47.480 --> 17:48.680
Dongfang Qingcang.

17:51.120 --> 17:53.480
Please wake up. Please.

17:55.320 --> 17:56.920
As long as you wake up,

17:58.080 --> 18:01.400
no matter
how much you hurt me or lie to me,

18:01.480 --> 18:03.480
I won't be angry.

18:05.640 --> 18:07.000
I beg you.

18:08.200 --> 18:10.320
Don't leave me alone.

18:41.440 --> 18:42.360
You're awake.

18:43.640 --> 18:45.680
You're finally awake!

18:56.560 --> 19:00.760
I was scared to death, you know?

19:13.600 --> 19:14.640
I'm fine.

19:16.040 --> 19:16.960
Don't cry.

19:19.840 --> 19:21.080
I'm not crying.

19:21.800 --> 19:23.360
I'm just happy.

19:27.320 --> 19:28.280
Are you thirsty?

19:28.360 --> 19:30.000
I'll get you some water.

19:31.160 --> 19:32.440
You…

19:35.240 --> 19:36.480
It's all right now.

19:37.120 --> 19:38.360
I guess you don't know.

19:38.840 --> 19:41.840
My blood can bring the dead back to life.

19:42.360 --> 19:43.960
It's strange.

19:45.080 --> 19:47.760
Why does my blood have
such a miraculous effect?

19:49.640 --> 19:51.160
Why are you even thinking about this?

19:54.320 --> 19:56.160
Don't use your blood to save others again.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.920
I'm no exception.

19:58.400 --> 19:59.360
Do you hear me?

20:05.120 --> 20:07.760
How can you be angry
when you're so badly hurt?

20:10.840 --> 20:13.040
I'm willing to do it.

20:13.120 --> 20:14.560
It doesn't hurt at all.

20:14.640 --> 20:15.560
I'm not lying.

20:21.640 --> 20:23.120
Why did you save me?

20:24.160 --> 20:25.680
Didn't you always want to go home?

20:31.640 --> 20:33.040
Anyway…

20:33.120 --> 20:35.160
I can't go back anyway.

20:36.840 --> 20:38.760
Now that you've saved me,
you really can't.

20:41.120 --> 20:42.200
Why exactly?

20:45.240 --> 20:46.760
Let's not talk about that.

20:46.840 --> 20:47.800
You must be hungry.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.000
I'll go get you something to eat.

20:58.520 --> 20:59.360
Why?

21:01.080 --> 21:02.240
Because…

21:03.680 --> 21:04.520
Because I…

21:26.480 --> 21:27.760
My lord!

21:39.400 --> 21:40.240
Let's go.

21:46.640 --> 21:48.040
I want to jump into the river.

21:58.320 --> 22:00.120
I want to get out!

22:01.320 --> 22:02.240
Help!

22:03.120 --> 22:04.320
Why me?

22:05.000 --> 22:06.280
Let me go!

22:07.400 --> 22:09.000
Release me!

22:13.240 --> 22:15.320
Orchid, where are you?

22:21.280 --> 22:23.680
Those who were taken
by the Lord of Haishi to refine evil qi

22:23.760 --> 22:25.160
are suffering to this extent.

22:26.200 --> 22:27.280
Their spirits are broken.

22:27.360 --> 22:28.560
Their grievances are too deep

22:28.640 --> 22:29.640
for them to rest in peace.

22:30.920 --> 22:31.760
Among them,

22:32.240 --> 22:34.760
there are spirits
of the Moon Tribe and the Fairy Tribe.

22:35.640 --> 22:38.320
Could it be that the deaths
of the 3,000 heavenly soldiers

22:38.400 --> 22:40.000
were also the Lord of Haishi's doing?

22:42.600 --> 22:43.520
Let me go back!

22:43.600 --> 22:45.640
Everyone, please don't worry.

22:46.200 --> 22:47.520
Please bear with it for a while.

22:48.120 --> 22:49.200
I will find a way

22:50.160 --> 22:51.640
to purify your grievances

22:51.720 --> 22:52.720
and end your suffering.

23:01.640 --> 23:03.040
You couldn't use Hellfire?

23:04.880 --> 23:06.800
How could you get so badly injured?

23:08.040 --> 23:09.240
It was my fault.

23:09.320 --> 23:10.680
I failed to protect you.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.760
It was just a momentary loss of power.

23:13.480 --> 23:14.360
There's no need to panic.

23:16.040 --> 23:17.560
Cangyan Sea is now settled.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.360
The Kings of North and South You
are disloyal.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.920
If they find out about this,

23:21.000 --> 23:22.480
I fear they will cause unrest.

23:25.560 --> 23:26.960
Those two?

23:27.600 --> 23:29.760
Even if I can't use Hellfire,

23:29.840 --> 23:32.320
killing them won't be difficult.

23:32.400 --> 23:34.040
It's better to be safe than sorry.

23:35.360 --> 23:36.200
Moon Supreme,

23:36.760 --> 23:37.760
focus on recovering.

23:38.320 --> 23:40.920
Shangque and I will keep this a secret.

23:42.360 --> 23:44.520
We'll wait for you
to recover from your injuries.

23:44.600 --> 23:46.040
Thank you.

23:46.600 --> 23:47.520
Don't mention it.

23:48.240 --> 23:50.320
You and I are brothers.

24:03.880 --> 24:04.960
That's right.

24:05.840 --> 24:07.080
We are brothers.

24:09.360 --> 24:10.240
I'll leave now.

24:20.440 --> 24:21.480
I'll see Lord Xunfeng off.

24:35.720 --> 24:36.640
Have some medicine.

24:53.040 --> 24:54.120
Why are you smiling?

24:54.680 --> 24:56.040
I think

24:56.120 --> 24:59.040
my wish seems to have come true.

24:59.600 --> 25:00.760
What wish?

25:02.360 --> 25:03.880
Forget it. Don't ask.

25:03.960 --> 25:05.760
Drink the medicine. It's getting cold.

25:32.360 --> 25:33.640
Since you're done,

25:34.120 --> 25:35.320
I'll leave now.

26:10.840 --> 26:11.960
Get some rest.

26:13.360 --> 26:14.480
You too.

26:52.800 --> 26:53.680
What?

26:54.640 --> 26:57.320
She's the reason
the Moon Supreme was seriously injured?

26:58.880 --> 27:00.360
And in order to save her,

27:01.120 --> 27:03.920
he even killed
the mortal reincarnation of Lady Chidi?

27:04.000 --> 27:05.240
Lord Xunfeng,

27:05.320 --> 27:06.440
don't disturb the lord.

27:07.400 --> 27:09.120
That fairy
keeps bothering the Moon Supreme.

27:11.080 --> 27:12.440
She's a real nuisance.

27:14.960 --> 27:16.440
I'll go and kill her now

27:17.000 --> 27:18.280
to eliminate future problems.

27:18.360 --> 27:19.360
Lord Xunfeng, you mustn't!

27:19.840 --> 27:20.720
Lord Xunfeng!

27:28.040 --> 27:29.560
It's just a fairy.

27:29.640 --> 27:30.840
Why can't I kill her?

27:36.880 --> 27:37.720
Moon Supreme.

27:39.280 --> 27:41.880
I'm connected to Orchid
by the One Heart Curse.

27:42.440 --> 27:44.200
We get injured and die together.

27:44.280 --> 27:45.400
If you kill her,

27:45.480 --> 27:46.960
you kill me.

27:52.040 --> 27:54.160
This is my greatest weakness now.

27:54.760 --> 27:56.040
I trust you.

27:59.320 --> 28:01.080
I will never reveal a word.

28:04.080 --> 28:05.640
You are the leader of the three realms,

28:06.200 --> 28:07.520
but now your life

28:07.600 --> 28:09.680
is in the hands of a weak fairy.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.040
How malicious

28:14.760 --> 28:16.400
is this woman?

28:16.960 --> 28:18.480
The curse on me was an accident.

28:19.360 --> 28:20.760
It has nothing to do with Orchid.

28:21.320 --> 28:23.400
On the contrary, if it weren't for her,

28:23.480 --> 28:25.760
I would still be imprisoned
in Haotian Tower.

28:26.600 --> 28:27.600
But in Lucheng,

28:28.200 --> 28:30.080
not only did she cause you
serious injuries,

28:30.720 --> 28:31.920
but she also ruined the plan

28:32.000 --> 28:33.400
to unseal 100,000 of our soldiers.

28:34.120 --> 28:35.320
What is she, if not a scourge?

28:37.680 --> 28:39.200
Are you blaming me?

28:42.560 --> 28:43.440
I don't dare.

28:43.920 --> 28:46.360
I blame myself too.

28:48.720 --> 28:51.360
Revenge on Shuiyuntian
for oppressing our tribe

28:52.360 --> 28:54.720
and the pain of Father
being forced to kill himself

28:55.560 --> 28:57.720
are always on my mind.

28:58.840 --> 29:01.120
The 100,000 soldiers in Xuanxu Realm

29:01.200 --> 29:03.320
pains me to the core even more.

29:04.040 --> 29:06.360
I perpetually yearn to break the seal

29:06.440 --> 29:07.840
and welcome them back.

29:08.760 --> 29:10.200
But now, it seems that

29:11.080 --> 29:13.360
I have indeed let down
the people of the Moon Tribe.

29:17.040 --> 29:18.440
- My lord.
- Moon Supreme.

29:20.080 --> 29:21.320
You haven't recovered yet.

29:21.960 --> 29:23.080
Don't wear yourself out.

29:24.320 --> 29:26.000
No one understands your desperation

29:26.080 --> 29:26.920
better than I do.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.240
But at this point,

29:28.320 --> 29:29.480
you should pretend

29:29.560 --> 29:31.720
that Lady Chidi's spirit
was destroyed 30,000 years ago

29:32.240 --> 29:34.000
without a single fragment remaining.

29:35.640 --> 29:36.880
Let's think of another way.

29:45.640 --> 29:47.280
Why are you standing here?

29:48.600 --> 29:49.480
Jieli,

29:49.560 --> 29:51.120
this is a sachet that I just made

29:51.200 --> 29:53.320
that can calm the mind.

29:54.720 --> 29:55.640
Me?

29:55.720 --> 29:57.120
You go and deliver it.

29:57.200 --> 29:59.040
- Me?
- I need to be alone.

30:00.520 --> 30:02.280
Orchid!

30:56.080 --> 30:57.520
Jieli said that you want to be alone.

30:58.320 --> 30:59.400
I can accompany you.

31:00.640 --> 31:01.560
Big Blockhead.

31:03.560 --> 31:04.840
You shouldn't have saved me.

31:06.640 --> 31:09.240
I don't need you to tell me what to do.

31:10.560 --> 31:13.560
I hope the former God of War
can pass her tribulation and ascend.

31:16.840 --> 31:18.600
I can't bear to see the soldiers

31:19.400 --> 31:21.400
forever sealed in the Xuanxu Realm,

31:22.600 --> 31:25.120
never able to see their loved ones.

31:26.600 --> 31:29.240
But we've failed
at these two matters because of me.

31:30.200 --> 31:31.040
And…

31:34.240 --> 31:36.120
I also caused you to get hurt.

31:36.760 --> 31:38.840
It was my decision to kill Xie Wanqing.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.280
You don't need to feel guilty about it.

31:41.360 --> 31:43.400
And I will never regret saving you

31:43.920 --> 31:44.880
at that time.

31:50.960 --> 31:52.560
There will be another way

31:53.320 --> 31:54.640
to free the Moon Tribe soldiers.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.720
But in all the three realms,

31:57.880 --> 31:59.640
I can't find

32:01.040 --> 32:03.640
another timid crybaby Orchid

32:04.960 --> 32:06.840
who likes to meddle

32:07.960 --> 32:09.640
and causes me a lot of trouble

32:10.560 --> 32:13.640
but also worries and takes care of me,

32:14.120 --> 32:17.000
makes me willing to regenerate
my Seven Emotions Tree for her,

32:18.480 --> 32:19.400
cry with her,

32:20.480 --> 32:21.920
and laugh with her.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.720
In my eyes,

32:40.400 --> 32:43.200
you have never been
an insignificant plant.

32:44.160 --> 32:46.160
You are not a plant at all.

32:50.080 --> 32:51.000
Orchid.

32:52.040 --> 32:53.960
Haven't you always wanted
to know who you are?

32:54.040 --> 32:54.960
Orchid.

32:59.960 --> 33:00.920
Lord Changheng?

33:28.000 --> 33:29.120
What are you doing here?

33:30.080 --> 33:31.520
To take Orchid away of course.

33:38.880 --> 33:40.360
Just try.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.480
If you want a problem,

33:47.560 --> 33:48.920
I'll give you a problem.

33:49.000 --> 33:49.960
Stop!

33:50.440 --> 33:52.480
Can you put down your swords first?

34:11.920 --> 34:13.400
Before I take Orchid away,

34:14.400 --> 34:15.840
I have something important to say.

34:22.760 --> 34:24.719
I think I've seen
such fragmented spirits before

34:24.800 --> 34:27.040
at Haishi's Soul Transformation Grounds.

34:28.000 --> 34:29.840
I've already destroyed
the Soul Transformation Cauldron.

34:29.920 --> 34:32.159
Why are they still unable
to return to the Oblivion River?

34:32.239 --> 34:34.639
These deceased were tortured
when they were alive.

34:35.199 --> 34:37.159
Their spirits can't return
to the Return to Ruin Realm

34:37.239 --> 34:38.679
because they are mutilated and lost.

34:39.239 --> 34:41.080
They wander the Oblivion River,

34:41.800 --> 34:43.159
unable to rest in peace.

34:43.239 --> 34:45.920
I will not tolerate such humiliation
for the people of the Moon Tribe.

34:46.000 --> 34:48.239
The souls of our heavenly warriors

34:48.320 --> 34:49.760
deserve to rest in peace.

35:00.560 --> 35:01.560
I have a way

35:02.520 --> 35:04.240
to appease and purify these spirits.

35:13.320 --> 35:15.480
Is this the "Spirit of Knowledge Book"?

35:17.040 --> 35:18.600
My master once told me

35:18.680 --> 35:20.400
that this is a song composed

35:20.480 --> 35:23.040
in ancient times
by the first Goddess of Xishan.

35:23.120 --> 35:24.280
It has the power

35:24.360 --> 35:25.840
to heal and purify the spirit.

35:25.920 --> 35:27.840
Lord Dong and Lady Yan

35:27.920 --> 35:29.000
once played it together

35:29.480 --> 35:30.760
in worship of heaven and earth.

35:30.840 --> 35:32.400
But for millions of years,

35:32.480 --> 35:34.760
although this tune has spread
throughout the three realms,

35:34.840 --> 35:36.640
no one could master it.

35:46.240 --> 35:47.200
I know.

35:47.840 --> 35:49.880
You're the Supreme Lord of the Moon Tribe.

35:50.440 --> 35:52.480
You're the God of War of the Fairy Realm.

35:52.560 --> 35:54.240
You two are the most powerful people

35:54.320 --> 35:55.560
in the two tribes.

35:55.640 --> 35:57.080
If you two can join forces,

35:57.160 --> 35:58.680
you will surely be able to master it.

35:58.760 --> 36:00.040
That's what I was thinking.

36:01.360 --> 36:03.440
Moon Supreme Lord, what do you think?

36:06.600 --> 36:08.720
He agrees. Of course he agrees.

36:16.000 --> 36:19.520
This concerns more than Lord Changheng.

36:19.600 --> 36:21.280
Moon Supreme Lord, you are so kind.

36:21.360 --> 36:24.120
I'm sure you won't abandon
the Moon Tribe people. Am I right?

36:40.400 --> 36:42.040
Since Orchid begged for a favor

36:43.000 --> 36:44.280
and there's a good reason for it,

36:48.160 --> 36:49.400
I'll allow it.

36:54.240 --> 36:55.200
The music score.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.560
Hold on.

37:36.640 --> 37:38.040
You two must be tired

37:38.120 --> 37:39.280
after practicing for so long.

37:39.360 --> 37:41.080
Take a drink of water and rest.

38:05.400 --> 38:07.520
One's music
can determine one's state of mind.

38:07.600 --> 38:09.280
The sound of your music just now

38:09.360 --> 38:11.000
was weak and feeble.

38:11.480 --> 38:14.560
It is just like Shuiyuntian's hypocrites

38:14.640 --> 38:16.920
who have been pampered for too long,

38:17.000 --> 38:18.280
becoming of little use

38:18.360 --> 38:21.320
and unable to take a single blow.

38:23.560 --> 38:25.360
The Moon Supreme is wrong about this.

38:25.440 --> 38:27.840
The "Spirit of Knowledge Book"
is a healing ritual song.

38:27.920 --> 38:30.720
Your music was disorderly,
barbaric, and crude.

38:31.280 --> 38:33.240
Music practice is like soldier training.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.160
One cannot be too hasty.

38:36.000 --> 38:37.320
If you rush into it,

38:37.400 --> 38:39.040
you will definitely remain stagnant.

38:42.880 --> 38:44.840
These two are not practicing the zither.

38:44.920 --> 38:46.600
They're obviously
making jabs at each other.

38:48.720 --> 38:50.640
Don't be so serious.

38:50.720 --> 38:54.040
You were friends before, weren't you?

38:54.120 --> 38:56.160
You even became sworn brothers in Lucheng.

38:56.240 --> 38:58.160
- What happened there doesn't count.
- What happened there doesn't count.

39:01.120 --> 39:04.080
You two are on the same page
about this though.

39:05.480 --> 39:06.960
The reason your music isn't in harmony

39:07.040 --> 39:08.480
may be because

39:08.560 --> 39:11.600
you don't really understand each other.

39:11.680 --> 39:13.560
The Fairy Tribe
and the Moon Tribe are at odds.

39:13.640 --> 39:15.000
This cooperation is just temporary.

39:15.080 --> 39:16.240
There's no understanding here.

39:16.320 --> 39:17.560
It's not like that.

39:17.640 --> 39:20.360
In fact, the Moon Tribe is not
as cruel and murderous as rumored

39:20.440 --> 39:22.160
in the Fairy Realm.

39:22.240 --> 39:23.120
On the contrary,

39:23.200 --> 39:24.520
they also long for peace and quiet

39:24.600 --> 39:26.080
because of constant warfare.

39:26.160 --> 39:28.760
And at first,
Moon Tribe's ancestor, Lady Yan,

39:28.840 --> 39:30.040
was betrayed by Chonghua.

39:30.120 --> 39:31.160
- So she--
- That's enough.

39:32.520 --> 39:34.760
The Moon Tribe doesn't need anyone
to defend them.

39:35.320 --> 39:36.720
That wasn't my intention.

39:37.280 --> 39:39.680
Moon Supreme Lord, you once said

39:39.760 --> 39:42.520
that you've been considerate of others
after your emotions were restored.

39:42.600 --> 39:44.400
You don't want your people to suffer

39:44.480 --> 39:46.640
from separation
from their loved ones like you did.

39:46.720 --> 39:49.320
If the Fairy Tribe and the Moon Tribe
can put aside prejudices

39:49.400 --> 39:50.920
and turn hostility into friendship,

39:51.000 --> 39:52.720
wouldn't your wish be fulfilled?

39:55.040 --> 39:57.720
How can the Moon Supreme change
because of what you just said?

40:00.520 --> 40:02.160
After all, you are not on the same side.

40:02.640 --> 40:05.760
Lord Changheng truly has other motives.

40:05.840 --> 40:08.640
I guess you don't really want
to cooperate with me either.

40:13.360 --> 40:14.200
This won't do.

40:14.280 --> 40:15.920
They don't see eye to eye.

40:16.000 --> 40:18.200
If this keeps up,
I'm afraid it won't end well.

40:19.040 --> 40:21.560
Moon Supreme Lord, take it easy.

40:21.640 --> 40:23.480
You haven't yet recovered.

40:23.560 --> 40:25.040
You mustn't strain your body and mind.

40:25.120 --> 40:26.840
Why don't you rest for today

40:26.920 --> 40:27.840
and practice again tomorrow?

40:27.920 --> 40:28.960
That's not necessary.

40:29.720 --> 40:33.040
It is still unknown
which tribe will emerge as the victor.

40:34.080 --> 40:36.000
But a victor can be decided

40:36.080 --> 40:37.920
between you and me today.

40:39.320 --> 40:40.160
That's good.

40:41.440 --> 40:42.480
I have the same intention.

40:45.920 --> 40:46.760
That's enough!

40:46.840 --> 40:48.040
As the Moon Supreme

40:48.120 --> 40:48.960
and the God of War,

40:49.040 --> 40:50.600
why don't you two have any decency?

42:15.840 --> 42:17.360
Greetings, my lord.

42:17.920 --> 42:19.000
What is happening here?

42:19.480 --> 42:22.440
My lord, we are making a sacrifice.

42:23.040 --> 42:23.920
A sacrifice?

42:25.520 --> 42:27.160
For the past 30,000 years,

42:27.240 --> 42:28.640
war has raged unceasingly.

42:29.400 --> 42:31.000
Every year at this time,

42:31.080 --> 42:33.160
we come to the Oblivion River

42:33.240 --> 42:35.320
to pay tribute to our dead husbands,

42:35.400 --> 42:36.880
brothers, and sons.

42:37.840 --> 42:39.880
We release lanterns
and pray for blessings.

42:41.800 --> 42:42.840
Why do these clay dolls

42:44.920 --> 42:46.280
have no faces?

42:48.080 --> 42:50.360
It's because they've been gone too long

42:50.440 --> 42:52.640
for us to remember how they look.

42:53.560 --> 42:56.880
And we don't know where their spirits are

42:58.040 --> 43:00.800
or whether they've returned
to the bottom of the Oblivion River

43:00.880 --> 43:02.240
to rest.

43:07.000 --> 43:08.120
My lord,

43:08.200 --> 43:10.160
do you still remember

43:10.760 --> 43:12.120
what I told you last time?

43:15.600 --> 43:16.520
I do.

43:18.560 --> 43:19.960
I will do it.

43:20.760 --> 43:22.880
I will bring our 100,000 soldiers back

43:23.760 --> 43:24.720
from the Xuanxu Realm.
